visibly connect to the stone mainland promenade with actual drawn wooden footbridges. Currently left and right piers are floating: regenerate the full coherent image and add a continuous narrow vertical wooden bridge from mainland around x220,y220 straight down to the LEFT dock around x220,y310, and another continuous narrow vertical wooden bridge from mainland around x730,y220 straight down to RIGHT dock around x730,y315. These connecting bridges sit over water on pilings with railings and join the existing dock paving without gaps. Keep central pier attached too. Preserve the existing north pathway near x740 and western stone path near y180 seen in this supplied reference; those new positions are fine. Do not move pier ends out of bottom boundary. Whole image only, not a composite patch."
