      "asset": "web/img/maps/exterior/4-1.webp",
      "prompt": "Use case: complete replacement pixel-art RPG map. Repaint the ENTIRE reference as ONE coherent finished image, not patches or collage. Match its detailed top-down oblique 2D pixel-art scale and palette. Landscape 3:2, logical coordinates 960x640. Real continuous travel paths must reach their specified outer edges with NO trees, hedges, walls, stalls or rocks crossing them. Whole tree crowns set back from every opening. No people, UI, debug grids, arrows or watermark. Keep each existing landmark and its role. All unspecified map boundaries closed naturally. Map Puncak Sinyal: keep white observatory dome and telecom towers on upper-right mountain summit, full distant blue mountains/clouds/lake and waterfall to left, winding dirt trail and stairs ascending mountain, intact wooden railings and rocks. Observatory front door around x675,y165, clear terrace around x850,y165. Keep broad walkable grassy BASECAMP meadow in lower half with spots near x380,y470, x515,y545,x615,y455 and x860,y570. SOUTH entry from coast centred EXACT x330,width60 x300..360: paint a real dirt approach from bottom edge y640 straight north to y540 in the meadow. Remove foreground tree obstruction specifically by redesigning the entire vegetation composition, no cropped crowns. EAST exit to station centred EXACT y600,width70 y565..635: real continuous dirt path from meadow across lower right to x960, straight final150px. All tree crowns and rocky slopes above y545 at the eastern approach. Keep clear grassy patch near x770,y520. No west or north exit. Make both south and east approach clear real terrain, not paths ending inside trees or off cliffs."
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "asset": "web/img/maps/exterior/3-4.webp",
      "prompt": "Use case: complete replacement pixel-art RPG map. Repaint the ENTIRE reference as one coherent finished scene, no pasted patches or collage. Match its detailed top-down oblique 2D pixel-art style and scale. Landscape 3:2, logical coordinates 960x640. Buildings, trees, ponds, rocks and planted beds visibly solid; pedestrian paths clear. Whole tree crowns set back from openings, no sliced trees. No characters, UI, debug grids, arrows or watermarks. Only the specified travel openings; all other map boundaries closed naturally by landscaping. Return the full map image. Map: Stasiun Sela. Keep the red/white commuter train and rails across top y0..80, metal-roof left platform shelter x70..390,y60..185, right station ticket-office/clinic building x620..890,y60..200 with a small clinic-marked door around x848,y205, central platform steps x430..530,y150..200, and broad tiled public plaza y200..530. WEST opening at EXACTLY y360, width70 y325..395, straight uninterrupted tiled walkway from left boundary x0 into plaza. It connects Puncak Sinyal. EAST opening at EXACTLY y360, width70 y325..395, tiled walkway goes straight through x960 from plaza to Pasar Malam. Both openings should share one continuous horizontal paving axis. Small intact garden near lower left x90..240,y410..515, clear access beside it near x250,y460. Close SOUTH boundary with continuous planted wall/whole shrubs instead of the former centre south gate and path. No south exit; no north exit across train tracks. Entire buildings, pillars, lamps and planted beds stay off the west/east paths."
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "asset": "web/img/maps/exterior/3-2.webp",
      "prompt": "Use case: complete replacement pixel-art RPG map. Repaint the ENTIRE reference as one coherent finished scene, no pasted patches or collage. Match its detailed top-down oblique 2D pixel-art style and scale. Landscape 3:2, logical coordinates 960x640. Buildings, trees, ponds, rocks and planted beds visibly solid; pedestrian paths clear. Whole tree crowns set back from openings, no sliced trees. No characters, UI, debug grids, arrows or watermarks. Only the specified travel openings; all other map boundaries closed naturally by landscaping. Return the full map image. Map: Kampung Bengkel. Retain Indonesian motorcycle workshops, metal roofs, tiled-roof corner office and parts shop, motorcycles, tools and tyres beside the buildings, central workbench about x480,y330, large concrete yard y210..530. Redesign the north building row into TWO connected workshop clusters left x180..415,y20..190 and right x550..900,y20..190, leaving a designed straight north passage at EXACTLY x480,width80 x440..520, from top y0 into yard y220. It connects the south gate of Pasar Malam above. NORTH is the sole incoming travel opening. Left cluster includes front-facing Kantor Bengkel office door near x225,y160; right cluster includes front-facing Kios Suku Cadang door near x800,y185. Both doors open onto clear public paving. Make north passage wide and natural between buildings, no obstructing roofs or motorcycles. EAST outgoing opening at EXACTLY y380,width60 y350..410, yard paving extends straight to x960, to Taman Waduk. Close old WEST opening with intact wall/greenery and close SOUTH perimeter with whole shrubs and wall. Keep clear activity areas near x280,y300, x700,y300, x690,y220, x780,y360, x515,y465, x415,y385."
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "asset": "web/img/maps/exterior/3-3.webp",
      "prompt": "Use case: complete replacement pixel-art RPG map. Repaint the ENTIRE reference as ONE coherent finished image, not patches or collage. Match its detailed top-down oblique 2D pixel-art scale and palette. Landscape 3:2, logical coordinates 960x640. Real continuous travel paths must reach their specified outer edges with NO trees, hedges, walls, stalls or rocks crossing them. Whole tree crowns set back from every opening. No people, UI, debug grids, arrows or watermark. Keep each existing landmark and its role. All unspecified map boundaries closed naturally. Map Taman Waduk: preserve turquoise reservoir across upper y0..165 with lily pads and buoys, boardwalk, pavilion over the lake at upper right, benches and lamps along north shore, large rectangular tiled plaza x100..900,y220..520, rectangular lawn x225..365,y330..415 and planted square x590..710,y330..420, whole trees and perimeter hedges. WEST entry at EXACT y350,width60 y320..380: paved path reaches x0 from plaza, with real gap in west wall. EAST exit at EXACT y380,width60 y350..410: matching paved path reaches x960 from plaza through a real open gap in east wall and hedge, straight final100px. These two gates must be real drawn openings, walls stop at each side, trees are set back. Close south boundary with continuous hedge/wall, no south road. Integrate SMALL medical clinic with red cross on lower-left edge x135..225,y440..520, door around x180,y530, matches painting's perspective and pixels. Keep clear public paving near x250,y525, x370,y480, x550,y475, x750,y465; north food stand around x620,y190 and spots x300,y210, x480,y235, x795,y180. No north exit through water."
